{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17771","headline":"夏日裴尹员外西斋看花 · 杨巨源","name":"夏日裴尹员外西斋看花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笑向东来客，看花枉在前。\n始知清夏月，更胜艳阳天。\n露湿呈妆污，风吹畏火燃。\n葱茏和叶盛，烂熳压枝鲜。\n红彩当[铃]阁，清香到玉筵。\n蝶栖惊曙色，莺语滞晴烟。\n得地殊堪赏，过时倍觉妍。\n芳菲迟最好，唯是谢家怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}